  "local_avatar_path": "",
  "content_html": "<div id=\"main\">\n\t\t<section id=\"primary\">\n\t\t\t<div id=\"profile\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cover\" style=\"background-image: url();\"><div class=\"scores\"><span class=\"score-label\">累積人氣<span class=\"score\"></span></span><span class=\"score-label\">累積讚數<span class=\"score\"></span></span><span class=\"score-label\">台客獎章<span class=\"score\"></span></span></div></div><div class=\"author-info\"><img src=\"http://www.gravatar.com/avatar/07b2da9e644cadef05fdc3a1d0faa8f3?d=http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/plugins/avatar/mystery-man.jpg&amp;s=150\" alt=\"\" class=\"avatar user-32-avatar\" width='150' height='150' /><h2 class=\"name-title\">Gene Lian</h2><h3 class=\"description\"></h3><div class=\"bio\"></div></div>\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<hr>\n\t\t\t<h2>Gene Lian 發表的文章</h2>\n\t\t\t<div id=\"content\" role=\"main\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"article-div divider\">\t\t\t\t\n<article id=\"post-2223\" class=\"post-2223 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-b2g category-javascript tag-alarm-api tag-firefox-os tag-system-message-api tag-web-api\">\n\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/2223/%e8%b5%b7%e5%ba%8a%e5%9b%89%ef%bc%81%e6%88%91%e7%9a%84%e6%89%8b%e6%a9%9f%e5%af%b6%e8%b2%9d%ef%bc%81-alarm-api-%e7%9a%84%e4%bd%bf%e7%94%a8%e8%88%87%e4%bb%8b%e7%b4%b9\" title=\"Permalink to 起床囉！我的手機寶貝！– Alarm API 的使用與介紹\" rel=\"bookmark\">起床囉！我的手機寶貝！– Alarm API 的使用與介紹</a></h2>\n    <p class=\"entry-posted\">\n      <time datetime=\"2014-05-14T10:01:17+00:00\" title=\"2014-05-14T10:01:17+00:00\" class=\"published\">\n        <a title=\"See all posts from May, 2014\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/date/2013/05\" class=\"posted-month\">5月</a>\n        <span class=\"posted-date\">29</span>\n        <a title=\"See all posts from 2014\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/date/2013\" class=\"posted-year\">2013</a>\n      </time>\n    </p>\n      \t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n      <div class=\"author-meta\" data-author-id=\"32\">\n        <a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/author/clianmozilla-com\">\n          <img src=\"http://www.gravatar.com/avatar/07b2da9e644cadef05fdc3a1d0faa8f3?d=http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/plugins/avatar/mystery-man.jpg&amp;s=24\" alt=\"\" class=\"avatar user-32-avatar\" width='24' height='24' /><!--\n       --><div class=\"author-info\">Gene Lian</div><!--\n       --><div class=\"author-title\"></div>\n        </a>\n        </div>\n      </div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n\t\t\t</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n\n\t<div class=\"thumb-img\"><img src=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/2013/05/wake_up_call-b9d5fcf0af27e5611e92285c9034f311-300x288-150x150.jpg\"/></div>\t<div class=\"entry-content half\">\n\t\t功能簡介\r\nAlarm API 最初是為了 FireFox OS (FFOS) 所特別開發的一種 Web API，可以在預定時間自動喚醒系統去執行特定作業；這種功能可以套用在許多實際的應用上，最容易聯想到的功能就是 Alarm Clock 的應用，有了這個 API 我們就可以要求 FFOS 在某個時間點，讓裝置自動產生振動或是鬧鈴來通知使用者，藉此實現一個 Alarm Clock Applicat.....<a class=\"more\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/2223/%e8%b5%b7%e5%ba%8a%e5%9b%89%ef%bc%81%e6%88%91%e7%9a%84%e6%89%8b%e6%a9%9f%e5%af%b6%e8%b2%9d%ef%bc%81-alarm-api-%e7%9a%84%e4%bd%bf%e7%94%a8%e8%88%87%e4%bb%8b%e7%b4%b9\">深入了解</a>  \n\t</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n\t\n  <footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n            <div class=\"entry-category-box\">\n      文章分類：\n      <a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/category/b2g\" rel=\"category tag\">Firefox OS(B2G)</a>、<a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/category/javascript\" rel=\"category tag\">Javascript</a>    </div>\n        <div class=\"entry-social-box\">\n      社群分享：\n     <div class=\"fb-like\" data-href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/2223/%e8%b5%b7%e5%ba%8a%e5%9b%89%ef%bc%81%e6%88%91%e7%9a%84%e6%89%8b%e6%a9%9f%e5%af%b6%e8%b2%9d%ef%bc%81-alarm-api-%e7%9a%84%e4%bd%bf%e7%94%a8%e8%88%87%e4%bb%8b%e7%b4%b9\" data-layout=\"button_count\" data-width=\"40\" data-show-faces=\"false\" data-font=\"arial\"></div>     <!-- Place this tag where you want the +1 button to render. -->\n     \n     <div class=\"google-share\"><div class=\"g-plusone\" name=\"gplus\" data-size=\"medium\" data-annotation=\"bubble\" data-width=\"40\" data-href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/2223/%e8%b5%b7%e5%ba%8a%e5%9b%89%ef%bc%81%e6%88%91%e7%9a%84%e6%89%8b%e6%a9%9f%e5%af%b6%e8%b2%9d%ef%bc%81-alarm-api-%e7%9a%84%e4%bd%bf%e7%94%a8%e8%88%87%e4%bb%8b%e7%b4%b9\"></div></div>     \n    <div class=\"pinterest-share\"><a href=\"http://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/2223/%e8%b5%b7%e5%ba%8a%e5%9b%89%ef%bc%81%e6%88%91%e7%9a%84%e6%89%8b%e6%a9%9f%e5%af%b6%e8%b2%9d%ef%bc%81-alarm-api-%e7%9a%84%e4%bd%bf%e7%94%a8%e8%88%87%e4%bb%8b%e7%b4%b9&media=http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/2013/05/wake_up_call-b9d5fcf0af27e5611e92285c9034f311-300x288-150x150.jpg\" data-pin-do=\"buttonPin\" data-pin-config=\"none\" data-pin-color=\"red\" class=\"pin-it-button\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"//assets.pinterest.com/images/PinExt.png\" title=\"Pin It\" /></a></div>      <div class=\"plurk-share\">\n        <a href=\"javascript: void(window.open('http://www.plurk.com/?qualifier=shares&status=' .concat(encodeURIComponent('http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/2223/%e8%b5%b7%e5%ba%8a%e5%9b%89%ef%bc%81%e6%88%91%e7%9a%84%e6%89%8b%e6%a9%9f%e5%af%b6%e8%b2%9d%ef%bc%81-alarm-api-%e7%9a%84%e4%bd%bf%e7%94%a8%e8%88%87%e4%bb%8b%e7%b4%b9')) .concat(' ') .concat('&#40;') .concat(encodeURIComponent(document.title)) .concat('&#41;')));\">\n          <img src=\"https://s.plurk.com/2980c7bcb4eb012159e7701a61cb2e75.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"plurk share\">\n        </a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"comment-share\">\n        <a class=\"comment-button\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/2223/%e8%b5%b7%e5%ba%8a%e5%9b%89%ef%bc%81%e6%88%91%e7%9a%84%e6%89%8b%e6%a9%9f%e5%af%b6%e8%b2%9d%ef%bc%81-alarm-api-%e7%9a%84%e4%bd%bf%e7%94%a8%e8%88%87%e4%bb%8b%e7%b4%b9#respond\">留言<div class=\"count-bubble\">10</div></a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n</article><!-- #post-2223 -->\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"article-div divider\">\t\t\t\t\n<article id=\"post-796\" class=\"post-796 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-b2g category-mozilla\">\n\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/796/%e5%8d%81%e5%b9%b4%e4%b8%80%e8%a6%ba%e7%a8%8b%e5%bc%8f%e5%a4%a2\" title=\"Permalink to 十年一覺程式夢\" rel=\"bookmark\">十年一覺程式夢</a></h2>\n    <p class=\"entry-posted\">\n      <time datetime=\"2014-05-14T10:01:17+00:00\" title=\"2014-05-14T10:01:17+00:00\" class=\"published\">\n        <a title=\"See all posts from May, 2014\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/date/2012/09\" class=\"posted-month\">9月</a>\n        <span class=\"posted-date\">17</span>\n        <a title=\"See all posts from 2014\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/date/2012\" class=\"posted-year\">2012</a>\n      </time>\n    </p>\n      \t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n      <div class=\"author-meta\" data-author-id=\"32\">\n        <a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/author/clianmozilla-com\">\n          <img src=\"http://www.gravatar.com/avatar/07b2da9e644cadef05fdc3a1d0faa8f3?d=http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/plugins/avatar/mystery-man.jpg&amp;s=24\" alt=\"\" class=\"avatar user-32-avatar\" width='24' height='24' /><!--\n       --><div class=\"author-info\">Gene Lian</div><!--\n       --><div class=\"author-title\"></div>\n        </a>\n        </div>\n      </div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n\t\t\t</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content \">\n\t\t又是另外一個執著於把問題解決才想回家的夜晚，等著程式編譯好的同時，不妨來談談我的程式夢。但在這之前，我想我必須先釐清一下一般人對於寫程式的迷思，那就是：千萬別對寫程式這回事懷抱任何美好想像，它其實一點都不像電影裡所演的那樣優雅，駭客緊盯著螢幕敲敲鍵盤就能運籌帷幄、呼風喚雨，在一個真實的世界裡，等著你的永遠只是一堆讓人難堪又難以下嚥的 bug！\r\n\r\n這些話在這個鼓勵有夢最美的年代聽起來頗危言聳聽，.....<a class=\"more\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/796/%e5%8d%81%e5%b9%b4%e4%b8%80%e8%a6%ba%e7%a8%8b%e5%bc%8f%e5%a4%a2\">深入了解</a>  \n\t</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n\t\n  <footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n            <div class=\"entry-category-box\">\n      文章分類：\n      <a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/category/b2g\" rel=\"category tag\">Firefox OS(B2G)</a>、<a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/category/mozilla\" rel=\"category tag\">Mozilla</a>    </div>\n        <div class=\"entry-social-box\">\n      社群分享：\n     <div class=\"fb-like\" data-href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/796/%e5%8d%81%e5%b9%b4%e4%b8%80%e8%a6%ba%e7%a8%8b%e5%bc%8f%e5%a4%a2\" data-layout=\"button_count\" data-width=\"40\" data-show-faces=\"false\" data-font=\"arial\"></div>     <!-- Place this tag where you want the +1 button to render. -->\n     \n     <div class=\"google-share\"><div class=\"g-plusone\" name=\"gplus\" data-size=\"medium\" data-annotation=\"bubble\" data-width=\"40\" data-href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/796/%e5%8d%81%e5%b9%b4%e4%b8%80%e8%a6%ba%e7%a8%8b%e5%bc%8f%e5%a4%a2\"></div></div>     \n    <div class=\"pinterest-share\"><a href=\"http://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/796/%e5%8d%81%e5%b9%b4%e4%b8%80%e8%a6%ba%e7%a8%8b%e5%bc%8f%e5%a4%a2&media=http://mozilla.com.tw/assets/css/img/mozcomtw/channels-firefox.png\" data-pin-do=\"buttonPin\" data-pin-config=\"none\" data-pin-color=\"red\" class=\"pin-it-button\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"//assets.pinterest.com/images/PinExt.png\" title=\"Pin It\" /></a></div>      <div class=\"plurk-share\">\n        <a href=\"javascript: void(window.open('http://www.plurk.com/?qualifier=shares&status=' .concat(encodeURIComponent('http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/796/%e5%8d%81%e5%b9%b4%e4%b8%80%e8%a6%ba%e7%a8%8b%e5%bc%8f%e5%a4%a2')) .concat(' ') .concat('&#40;') .concat(encodeURIComponent(document.title)) .concat('&#41;')));\">\n          <img src=\"https://s.plurk.com/2980c7bcb4eb012159e7701a61cb2e75.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"plurk share\">\n        </a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"comment-share\">\n        <a class=\"comment-button\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/796/%e5%8d%81%e5%b9%b4%e4%b8%80%e8%a6%ba%e7%a8%8b%e5%bc%8f%e5%a4%a2#respond\">留言<div class=\"count-bubble\">9</div></a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n</article><!-- #post-796 -->\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><!-- #content -->\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</section><!-- #primary -->\n\n\t\t<div id=\"secondary\" class=\"widget-area\" role=\"complementary\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<aside id=\"moztech_authors-2\" class=\"widget Moztech_Authors_Widget\"><h1 class=\"widget-title\">台客編輯群</h1><div class=\"moztech-authors-widget\"><a data-author-id=\"103\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/author/jaliumozilla-com\"><img src=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/avatars/103/d96ea068531579cee55cae03f8941426-bpthumb.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"avatar user-103-avatar\" width='96' height='96' /></a><a data-author-id=\"43\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/author/atsaimozilla-com\"><img src=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/avatars/43/a6cb93e0f29946536e6259520c22755e-bpthumb.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"avatar user-43-avatar\" width='96' height='96' /></a><a data-author-id=\"133\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/author/ofengmozilla-com\"><img src=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/avatars/133/432bb0b63e564de1095abda72d01cd95-bpthumb.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"avatar user-133-avatar\" width='96' height='96' /></a><a data-author-id=\"60\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/author/gasolinmozilla-com\"><img src=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/avatars/60/2af25d5bedc5219a5e66b8d4012b6b11-bpthumb.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"avatar user-60-avatar\" width='96' height='96' /></a><a data-author-id=\"33\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/author/pwangmozilla-com\"><img src=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/avatars/33/1f353454f159004931f05f3952d50664-bp